{
  "format": "bowerloom/engine-api-modules-golden/v1",
  "note": "The calls of the bowerloomModules bridge, added in 0.9.0-beta.1 after the base: the read scope of a module (the places a person approved for it, and the one read of a text file inside such a place). Written by hand, because the base source never had them: the base golden file stays as it is. Change it only with MODULE_CALLS, in the same commit.",
  "bridge": "bowerloomModules",
